# strings.list — encrypted-string manifest
#
# Format: <ENUM_NAME>|<plaintext string>
#
# ENUM_NAME becomes SVC_STR_<ENUM_NAME> at call sites.
# Blank lines + lines starting with # are ignored.
# UTF-8 (no BOM); \n / \r / \t are NOT interpreted — write literals.
#
# Every string here gets XOR-encrypted at build time by
# scripts/gen_str_enc.ps1 into shared/str_enc_generated.h. The runtime
# in shared/str_enc.c decrypts them in-place at DllMain / main() start.
#
# ONLY add strings that would identify this project to a reverse engineer
# looking at `strings dwmapiext.dll`. High-signal only — encrypting
# generic format strings adds size without meaningful RE friction.

# ─── Product identity ────────────────────────────────────────────
PRODUCT_NAME|CloakGPT
INSTALL_DIR_LEAKY|C:\ProgramData\WinAudioSvc
SVCLDB_TOKEN|svcldb
SVCLDB_API_KEY|SVCLDB_API_KEY

# ─── Named event (unique DWM injection fingerprint) ─────────────
SHUTDOWN_EVENT|Global\DwmCompositorShutdownRelease

# ─── Payload init / hook signatures ─────────────────────────────
PAYLOAD_INIT|=== payload init ===
PAYLOAD_READY|=== payload ready ===
HOOKS_INSTALLED|hooks_install: SUCCESS
HOOKS_UNINSTALLED|hooks uninstalled
HANDSHAKE_OK|init_thread: handshake ok
HANDSHAKE_BAD_HEADER|handshake: bad config header magic=%08x ver=%u (expect %08x/%u)
HANDSHAKE_TOKEN_INVALID|handshake: token INVALID - refusing to install hooks
CONFIG_UNAVAIL|config unavailable - payload will be inert
PEB_UNLINKED|peb_unlink: unlinked + spoofed BaseDllName -> %s (pick=%d)
PE_WIPED|pe_wipe: MZ+PE signatures corrupted

# ─── DWM hook function names (leak that we hook the compositor) ──
HOOK_PRESENT|COverlayContext::Present hooked @ %p
HOOK_DDPRESENT|CDDisplayRenderTarget::Present hooked @ %p
HOOK_LEGACY_PRESENT|CLegacyRenderTarget::Present hooked @ %p
HOOK_RC_WINDOW|CWindowNode::RenderContent hooked @ %p (capture stealth)
HOOK_RC_VISUAL|CVisual::RenderContent hooked @ %p (capture stealth)
HOOK_RC_WINDOW_FAIL|CWindowNode::RenderContent hook FAILED s=%d
HOOK_RC_VISUAL_FAIL|CVisual::RenderContent hook FAILED s=%d
HOOK_PN_DD|CDDisplayRenderTarget::PresentNeeded hooked @ %p
HOOK_PN_LEGACY|CLegacyRenderTarget::PresentNeeded hooked @ %p

# ─── AI provider headers (leak our AI integration) ───────────────
AUTH_HEADER_FMT|Authorization: Bearer %s
ANTHROPIC_VERSION|anthropic-version: 2023-06-01
OPENAI_CHAT_URL|https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions
ANTHROPIC_MSG_URL|https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages
GOOGLE_GEN_URL|https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models
OPENROUTER_URL|https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions

# ─── Model names (leak specific model choices) ───────────────────
MODEL_GEMINI_FLASH_LITE|gemini-2.5-flash-lite
MODEL_GEMINI_PRO|gemini-2.5-pro
MODEL_GEMINI_3_PRO|gemini-3.1-pro-preview
MODEL_GEMINI_3_FLASH|gemini-3.5-flash
MODEL_OPENAI_GPT55|gpt-5.5
MODEL_ANTHROPIC_OPUS|claude-opus-5

# ─── Resolver PDB symbol names (leak dwmcore RE target) ──────────
PDB_CVISUAL_RC|dwmcore!CVisual::RenderContent
PDB_CWNODE_RC|dwmcore!CWindowNode::RenderContent

# ─── User-facing error messages (leak internals) ─────────────────
ERR_INVALID_KEY_HINT|**Invalid API key.** Cycle providers via Ctrl+Shift+Alt+P or add a key at the dashboard.
ERR_RATE_LIMIT|**Rate limited.** Wait a minute or cycle to a cheaper tier with Ctrl+Alt+M.
ERR_MODEL_UNAVAIL|**Model not available.** Cycle tier via Ctrl+Alt+M.
NO_QUESTION|NO_QUESTION_DETECTED

# ─── Sub-check messages ──────────────────────────────────────────
SUBCHK_THREAD_UP|sub_check: thread up (jitter+backoff)
SUBCHK_SELF_UNLOAD|sub_check: SELF-UNLOAD trigger (%s)
SUBCHK_INACTIVE|subscription_inactive
SUBCHK_NET_FAIL|too_many_network_failures

# ─── Rawinput / hotkey signatures ────────────────────────────────
RIN_CLASS|MSDiagEventSink
RIN_REGISTERED|WM_HOTKEY fired slot=%d
